  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 12 November 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nA Prime Location, a Solid Opportunity, and Plenty of Potential!\r\n\r\nThey say you can change a house, but you can't change its location. And when it comes to convenience, this Milford address is hard to beat!\r\n\r\nPositioned in the heart of a highly convenient North Shore neighbourhood, this three-bedroom home offers approximately 120m² of floor area and an exciting opportunity to add your own touch.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer looking for a place to call your own, an investor seeking a property in a well connected location, or a renovator ready to unlock its potential, this could be exactly what you've been waiting for.\r\n\r\nLeave the Car at Home – Everything Is Within Reach!\r\n• One of the biggest attractions here is the exceptional location. Enjoy the freedom of having schools, transport, healthcare and lifestyle amenities all within easy reach.\r\n• Walk to Westlake Boys' & Girls' High Schools – a fantastic location for families who value education, with both popular secondary schools close to home.\r\n• Walk to North Shore Hospital – particularly convenient for healthcare professionals and hospital staff.\r\n•  Walk to Smales Farm Bus Station – enjoy easy access to the Northern Busway for commuting to Auckland CBD and beyond.\r\n• Smales Farm & Goodside – cafés, restaurants, businesses and everyday conveniences are just a stroll away.\r\n• Milford Shopping Centre & Beach – enjoy the shopping, dining and coastal lifestyle that make Milford such a desirable place to live.\r\n• Easy Motorway Connections – making travel across Auckland simple and convenient.\r\n\r\nThree Bedrooms, Endless Possibilities\r\n\r\nWith three bedrooms and approximately 120m² of floor area, this home provides a practical starting point for your next chapter.\r\n\r\nMove in and renovate at your own pace, give it a fresh makeover to suit your lifestyle, or explore its potential as a rental investment.\r\n\r\nFor those with an eye for improvement, this is your chance to transform an established property into something special.\r\n\r\nA Location That Works for Everyone\r\n\r\nFor first-home buyers, it's an opportunity to secure a foothold in Milford without paying a premium for someone else's renovation.\r\n\r\nFor investors, the proximity to North Shore Hospital, Smales Farm, major transport links and popular schools offers appeal to a wide range of prospective tenants.\r\n\r\nFor renovators, the combination of an established home and a convenient location provides an exciting canvas for your next project.\r\n\r\nThe Address Is the Advantage. The Potential Is the Opportunity.\r\n\r\nBring your imagination, roll up your sleeves and make the most of what this property has to offer.\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are well worth a closer look.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing!",
